WEBVTT

00:04:31.036 --> 00:04:35.036
And biodiversity also gives us
clean air and water,

00:04:35.076 --> 00:04:40.636
food and protection from floods,
storms and even wildfires.

00:04:43.396 --> 00:04:46.956
The problem is that nature
cannot keep up with us.

00:04:48.196 --> 00:04:50.076
The biodiversity that is left today

00:04:50.116 --> 00:04:53.036
is not enough to absorb
our impacts any longer.

00:04:54.596 --> 00:04:55.916
That's why in 2018,

00:04:55.956 --> 00:04:58.596
I put together a team
of top scientists and economists

00:04:58.596 --> 00:05:02.796
to answer the question of which areas
in the ocean we must protect first.